    {
      "text": "word of the Lord came … in a vision, Gen. 15:1. God spake … in the visions of the night, Gen. 46:2. Lord will make myself known unto him in a vision, Num. 12:6. saw the vision of the Almighty, Num. 24:4. word of the Lord … was no open vision, 1 Sam. 3:1. Samuel feared to shew Eli the vision, 1 Sam. 3:15. according to all this vision, so did Nathan speak, 2 Sam. 7:17 (1 Chr. 17:15). had understanding in the visions of God, 2 Chr. 26:5. thoughts from the visions of the night, Job 4:13. thou … terrifiest me through visions, Job 7:14. In a dream, in a vision of the night, Job 33:15 (2 Ne. 27:3). thou spakest in vision to thy holy one, Ps. 89:19. no vision, the people perish, Prov. 29:18. vision of Isaiah, Isa. 1:1. burden of the valley of vision, Isa. 22:1. they err in vision, Isa. 28:7. vision of all is become unto you as the words of a book, Isa. 29:11. word of the Lord … saying … what seest thou, Jer. 1:11. they prophesy … a false vision, Jer. 14:14. they speak a vision of their own heart, Jer. 23:16. her prophets also find no vision, Lam. 2:9. I saw visions of God, Ezek. 1:1. then shall they seek a vision of the prophet, Ezek. 7:26. spirit … brought me in the visions of God to Jerusalem, Ezek. 8:3. spirit … brought me in a vision … into Chaldea, Ezek. 11:24. days are prolonged, and every vision faileth, Ezek. 12:22. Have ye not seen a vain vision, Ezek. 13:7. In the visions of God brought he me into … Israel, Ezek. 40:2. visions were like the vision that I saw by the river, Ezek. 43:3. Daniel had understanding in all visions, Dan. 1:17. secret revealed unto Daniel in a night vision, Dan. 2:19. I saw in my vision by night, Dan. 7:2. vision appeared unto me … Daniel, Dan. 8:1. vision of the evening and the morning … is true, Dan. 8:26. Seventy weeks are determined … to seal up the vision, Dan. 9:24. Daniel alone saw the vision, Dan. 10:7. I have multiplied visions, Hosea 12:10. young men shall see visions, Joel 2:28 (Acts 2:17). vision of Obadiah, Obad. 1:1. ye shall not have a vision, Micah 3:6. book of the vision of Nahum, Nahum 1:1. Write the vision, and make it plain upon tables, Hab. 2:2. prophets shall be ashamed … of his vision, Zech. 13:4.",
